OL,3,GNEWSAOffice blocks plan for former
OL,4,Anewspaper site
OL,5,
OL,6,FMulti-storey office blocks could be
OL,7,Fbuilt on the former Yorkshire Post site
OL,8,Fin Leeds after student accommodation
OL,9,Fplans stalled.
OL,11,FA revised scheme has been drawn up for
OL,12,Fthe land on Wellington Street which
OL,13,Fwould see two blocks of 15 and 17
OL,14,Fstoreys built if given the go-ahead.
OL,16,FPrevious permission allowed for
OL,17,Fresidential tower blocks of 42, 32 and
OL,18,F25 storeys but a planning report by the
OL,19,Fapplicant, Urbanite Leeds Ltd, said the
OL,20,Fstudent housing scheme ran into
OL,21,Fcomplications.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
