OL,3,GNEWSAOffice blocks plan for former
OL,4,Anewspaper site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report said the current proposals for
OL,7,Fthe site, which was demolished in 2014,
OL,8,Fcould deliver more than 4,000 jobs and
OL,9,Fabout #2.65m in developer contributions
OL,10,Fto the city's infrastructure.
